For **goals.ts** — straightforward, I'll migrate all 4 handlers. Auth calls (`assertCompanyAccess`, `getActorInfo`) will be bridged via a cast.

For **companies.ts** — 13 handlers, complex auth including private helpers that also take `req: Request`.

